## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Effort | Rationale |
|----------|-------|--------|-----------|
| 1 | Assertion-Free Test | Low | False-pass risk — zero safety net |
| 2 | Sleepy Test | Low | Flaky CI + 2 s waste per run |
| 3 | Mystery Guest | Low | Broken on every machine but the author's |
| 4 | Conditional Test Logic | Medium | Hidden test gap — one branch never runs |
| 5 | Exception Handling | Low | One-line mechanical replacement |
| 6 | Sensitive Equality | Medium | Locale/format fragility |
| 7 | Magic Number Test | Medium | Readability; low breakage risk |
| 8 | Eager Test | Medium | Mark as integration or split |
| 9 | General Fixture | Low | Remove unused field |

